   "html": "<p>Universal Studios and Peacock once again tapped IHEARTCOMIX to produce an unforgettable VIP, press and influencer after party event following two simultaneous premiere screenings of Halloween Ends.</p>\n<p>We completely transformed and decked out the restaurant into a spooky hotspot with surprises to discover around every corner. Pumpkins galore, dedicated trick or treat stations, tarot reading room, themed cocktails and food, bumping tunes, unique photo moments and special appearances by Michael Myers made this a night to remember and to share, garnering a 72M+ social reach.</p>"
  }
 ],
