  {
   "title": "Immersive Decor",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Giant Jack O’Laterns, glowing pumpkins, strategic uplighting and gory body parts set the scene and immediately transported guests upon arrival. Staff wore Halloween costumes, and we even transformed the large Japanese garden in the center of the venue into a scene of Michael Myers’ destruction! In-world touches with the DJ booth staged as a radio station and Laurie’s diary on display made direct call backs to the film. Even the sushi platter got in on the action, spelling out ENDS.</p>"
    },
