   "title": "Photo Moments",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>A lifesize ENDS logo surrounded by Jack O’ Lanterns served as our hero branding moment and must-have photo backdrop for the night. In the custom 360 video booth, guests had the opportunity to stand back to back with Michael Myers, in a re-creation of the film’s poster. The final video output included blood splatter across the screen and a title treatment closer. Y2K nightlife photographer The Cobrasnake was also onsite capturing all the best party moments.</p>\n<p>“Photobooth 10/10 experience” - @eatherbrains</p>"
    },
